{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-integration","title":"存储集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/storage-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"object-storage-s3-gcs","title":"对象存储集成（S3/GCS/OSS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/storage-integration/object-storage-s3-gcs","wordCount":1177,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"storage-strategy-lifecycle","title":"存储策略与生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/storage-integration/storage-strategy-lifecycle","wordCount":1337,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"cdn-origin-optimization","title":"CDN 回源与分发优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/storage-integration/cdn-origin-optimization","wordCount":1517,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"存储集成\">存储集成</h1><p>文件从处理管道输出后，最终需要持久化到高可用的存储层并通过分发网络高效送达终端用户。对象存储（S3/GCS/OSS）以其无限扩展、按需付费、内建冗余的特性成为文件存储的事实标准。但将对象存储用好远非调用一个 PutObject API 那么简单——存储类别选择、生命周期策略、跨区域复制、CDN 回源架构等决策直接影响成本与性能。</p>\n<p>本章三篇文档各有侧重：第一篇聚焦对象存储本身的集成模式与 SDK 实践；第二篇上升到策略层面讨论冷热分层与自动过期；第三篇延伸到分发侧，探讨 CDN 如何与源站协作实现全球加速。</p>\n<p>三篇从「存进去」到「管起来」再到「分出去」，构成完整的数据生命线。</p>\n"}